  "bulletinLanguage": {
    "md5": "ea412c0112043913b1b4e627c983ba2f",
    "config": [
      {
        "key": "facebook_title",
        "value": "關注我們"
      },
      {
        "key": "facebook_content",
        "value": "<<<img=https://cdn.mergecola.com/cloud/5526a2509d6160ee7bce8d1661d71b23bfb5518a>>>\n歡迎您關注我們的 Facebook 頁面！\n\n在那裡，您可以瞭解火辣餐廳的最新消息。我們也會同步發送照片和活動，您還有機會贏取能量、鑽石和其他精彩獎勵！\n\n點擊下方按鈕進入 Facebook 頁面，關注我們！"
      },
      {
        "key": "digboard_error_title",
        "value": "Compensation Rewards"
      },
      {
        "key": "digboard_error_desc",
        "value": "Hey Chefs!\n\nWe discovered a little hiccup in the “Foraging for Funghi” event that may have stopped some of you from progressing. The issue is now fixed—just close and reopen the event to continue!\n\nSorry for the interruption—we will be sending out some rewards shortly to thank you for your patience!\n\nHappy merging!\nThe Flambé Team"
      },
      {
        "key": "energyEvent_title",
        "value": "体力大放送"
      },
      {
        "key": "energyEvent_content",
        "value": "<<<img=https://cdn.mergecola.com/cloud/832f6ad1417bf023254d29d7f6e94bb9a7734cb3>>>\n美食探險活動開始啦！快來參與體力抽獎活動，有機會贏取400體力哦！\n\n參與方式：\n1.關注我們的Facebook，@Flambé: Merge & Cook\n2.在評論區留下問題的答案\n3.我們將隨機抽取20位幸運兒\n\n點擊下方按鈕進入Facebook吧，祝你好運！"
      },
      {
        "key": "cardEvent_title",
        "value": "体力大放送"
      },
      {
        "key": "cardEvent_content",
        "value": "<<<img=https://cdn.mergecola.com/cloud/a1e38d7d955bf1f3c1e0561a96f1e2d78694d9d0>>>\n秋季集卡活動開始啦！快來參與體力抽獎活動，有機會贏取400體力哦！\n\n參與方式：\n1. 關注我們的Facebook，@Flambé: Merge & Cook\n2. 在評論區留下問題的答案\n3. 我們將隨機抽取20位幸運兒\n\n點擊下方按鈕進入Facebook吧，祝你好運！"
      },
      {
        "key": "adboard_error_title",
        "value": "Compensation Rewards"
      },
      {
        "key": "adboard_error_desc",
        "value": "Hey Chefs!\n\nSorry for the recent technical issues you may have encountered during the \"Feast of Spooky Sweets\" event. They have now all been fixed and the Feast is sweeter (and spookier!) than ever!\n\nTo show our thanks, we have attached our own sweet treat below! \n\nHappy merging!\nThe Flambé Team"
      },
      {
        "key": "fb_freegift_title",
        "value": "領取驚喜禮物"
      },
      {
        "key": "fb_freegift_desc",
        "value": "<<<img=https://cdn.mergecola.com/cloud/c8d381f4bcb2b7198e7ddf5e609d5dcf2aad92a5>>>\n點擊我們Facebook主頁貼子中的連結，就可以免費獲得體力或道具哦！\n\n參與答題抽獎活動，還有機會贏取更多獎勵！\n\n點擊下方按鈕進入Facebook，立即領取驚喜禮物吧！"
      }
    ]
  },
